# Kalacar owner dashboard: settings
#
# The dashboard has no database or secret keys of its own. It passes every request to the shop's API.
# Sign-in, Razorpay, Pusher and database settings all belong to the shop: see kalacar-app/.env.example.
# Full guide: kalacar_obsedian_voulte/21-production-settings.md

# ---- On your computer: copy to .env.local ----
# Development only. Where the local shop is running. Leave empty for http://127.0.0.1:3000.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# ---- On Hostinger: add under the dashboard site's Environment variables ----
# Production only. The shop's real address, used by server.cjs.
# Until launch it can stay unset, which uses the test shop address written in server.cjs.
# KALACAR_SHOP_URL=https://kalacar.in

# Production only. Hostinger normally sets this itself. Don't add it unless asked.
# PORT=5173
